That Council direct staff to proceed with consideration of the following variances for 3059 Jacklin Road
and 3061 Jacklin Road:

        a)   That Section 10(a)(i) of Sign Bylaw No. 1250 be varied to increase the maximum sign area of
             a façade sign from 25m2 or 17%, whichever is less, to 30m2 or 20%, whichever is less;

        b) That Section 11(a)(i) of Sign Bylaw No. 1250 be varied from the one freestanding sign per
           highway frontage to two freestanding signs per highway frontage along Jacklin Road;
